        "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (or Higher)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Modern Intel i7 or Better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1070 or Better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 400 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> Only Tested on Meta AirLink (Quest 2/3). Might not work on Non-Meta Headsets.<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> These are the specs for VR Mode.</li></ul>"
